“I've been getting paid a thousand dollars a&nbsp;
month if not more just from this app on my phone&nbsp;

00:01:09.900 --> 00:01:12.240
and I don't know if you can see&nbsp;
this but it's called Audible”

00:01:12.240 --> 00:01:17.700
These guys are part of the class of online&nbsp;
parasite we’ll be calling Contrepreneurs,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:17.700 --> 00:01:24.660
a mix of con-artist and entrepreneur the kind of&nbsp;
thoughtfluencing bootstrapper who shows you his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:24.660 --> 00:01:29.640
